osoft has announced that there will  be an extended showcase a few days later  promising even more reveals in a blog  post microsoft said that the xbox  showcase extended will take place  tuesday june 14th starting at 10 a.m  pacific 1 p.m eastern and this is  looking to be a lengthy one as well  clocking in at around 90 minutes which  is about the same duration as the main  xbox the showcase microsoft also hosted  an extended showcase last year in 2021  that featured news about halo hellblade  and more however there is no word yet on  what games may show up at this year's  extended event it seems we'll know more  following the main xbox showcase on june  12th so we'll make sure to keep you  updated and while we're on the subject  of xbox a goldeneye 007 remaster looks  like it may be coming sooner rather than  later vgc first reported that wario 64  who frequently tweets video game sales  and bargains spotted achievements for  goldeneye 007 on xbox servers this past  sunday this is not the first time that a  potential goldeneye remasters  achievements have leaked back in january  they leaked the exact same achievements  which can still be found on true  achievements considering the timing of  this leak and its proximity to the xbox  showcase on june 12th that goldeneye  double 07 remaster may be releasing even  sooner than we think however don't get  your hopes up too high until we have  that formal announcement elsewhere in  the world of james bond games io  interactive the developer behind the  hitman games has been steadily working  on its own bond game which will feature  a completely original story for the  world's most famous super spy now let's  pretend you're a super spy lay out the  plan for me how are you extracting  information about silk song before  summer game fest get creative don't make  it violent or weird though and i'll see  you in the next one  [Music]
 

